    "teaches": "Sweeping t moves a point along the helix while the live readout shows (cos t, sin t, t) and the accumulated arc length s = sqrt(2)*t, making concrete that ds = sqrt((dx/dt)^2+(dy/dt)^2+(dz/dt)^2) dt = sqrt(2) dt is constant along this helix"
