    "id": "orbitBox",
    "type": "orbit",
    "teaches": "Rotating the bounding box reveals how the single 3D helix projects to a circle in the xy-plane (top view) and to a sinusoid in the xz- and yz-planes (side views), explaining why x=cos t, y=sin t, z=t traces this path"
  }
]

DEMO STEPS (tween through these using goToStep(); each step drives the controls above):
